Cherrystone changes to Badwolf 1.3.0:
- new tabs open $CHERRYSTONE_HOME (the Cherrystone home page) instead of a blank page
- the usual browser keys: Ctrl+W closes a tab, Ctrl+Tab / Ctrl+Shift+Tab switch tabs,
  Alt+Left / Alt+Right go back / forward
- new tabs get keyboard focus in the page, so the shortcuts work straight away
- the JS and IMG toggle buttons are hidden (JavaScript is on by default via config.h)

